igure` is what forces image **c** to move to a new row.\n5.  **`0.7\\textwidth`**: For the bottom image, I set it to `0.7` so it doesn\u0027t look too massive, but you can change this to `1.0\\textwidth` if you want it to span the full width of the text.\n\n### If you don\u0027t have images ready:\nIf you are just testing the layout, replace the `\\includegraphics` lines with:\n`\\rule{\\textwidth}{3cm}` \nThis will draw a black box so you can see the placement immediately.",
